{
 "version": "map-v1-w1-b01",
 "_notes": [
  "mongodb-atlas family: identity lift of mmp_rt_src -> mmp_rt_billing_n. Collection names, _id values, field names and BSON types are preserved (profile: BSON identity).",
  "Every graded field is listed; the harness grades only declared fields. Sub-documents (settings, meta) and arrays (tags) are graded whole with identity.",
  "Per-batch scoping: each batch owns whole collections, so no ${param} placeholders are needed; root_where/target_where are intentionally absent.",
  "Data-quality decisions M1-M4 are in 09_compat_report.md and the STOP B row in 05_decisions.md. Only M4 (audit_events.ts string -> date) changes a value; it is graded by the spec alias audit_ts_string_to_date.",
  "Fixture mode uses the mechanical copy migration/mmp_rt/fixture_mapping_spec.json (root_table prefixed fx_src_); nothing else differs."
 ],
 "canonicalization": {
  "rules": [
   {
    "name": "audit_ts_string_to_date",
    "rule": "date_string_to_date",
    "applies_to": "audit_events.ts",
    "params": {
     "format": "%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z",
     "unparseable": "keep"
    }
   },
   {
    "name": "datetime_utc_truncate_ms",
    "rule": "datetime_utc_truncate_ms",
    "applies_to": "*",
    "params": {}
   },
   {
    "name": "null_missing_equiv",
    "rule": "null_missing_equiv",
    "applies_to": "*",
    "params": {}
   }
  ]
 },
 "collections": [
  {
   "collection": "users",
   "root_table": "users",
   "key": {
    "source": [
     "_id"
    ],
    "target": "_id"
   },
   "fields": [
    {
     "source": "email",
     "target": "email",
     "bson_type": "string",
     "rules": [
      "identity"
     ]
    },
    {
     "source": "displayName",
     "target": "displayName",
     "bson_type": "string",
     "rules": [
      "identity"
     ]
    },
    {
     "source": "role",
     "target": "role",
     "bson_type": "string",
     "rules": [
      "identity"
     ]
    },
    {
     "source": "settings",
     "target": "settings",
     "bson_type": "object",
     "rules": [
      "identity"
     ]
    },
    {
     "source": "createdAt",
     "target": "createdAt",
     "bson_type": "date",
     "rules": [
      "datetime_utc_truncate_ms"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "embeds": []
  },
  {
   "collection": "folders",
   "root_table": "folders",
   "key": {
    "source": [
     "_id"
    ],
    "target": "_id"
   },
   "fields": [
    {
     "source": "name",
     "target": "name",
     "bson_type": "string",
     "rules": [
      "identity"
     ]
    },
    {
     "source": "path",
     "target": "path",
     "bson_type": "string",
     "rules": [
      "identity"
     ]
    },
    {
     "source": "parentId",
     "target": "parentId",
     "bson_type": "objectId",
     "rules": [
      "null_missing_equiv"
     ]
    },
    {
     "source": "ownerId",
     "target": "ownerId",
     "bson_type": "objectId",
     "rules": [
      "identity"
     ]
    },
    {
     "source": "createdAt",
     "target": "createdAt",
     "bson_type": "date",
     "rules": [
      "datetime_utc_truncate_ms"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "embeds": []
  }
 ]
}
